_mode` option to `simple`.","collection_data_file_slug_tag":"The `{$prop}` option can’t contain the `\\{\\{slug\\}\\}` tag in a collection with the `file` option, as an entry’s slug is its position, which changes when the entries are reordered or deleted. Use a field with a unique value instead.","invalid_slug_slash":"The slug template `{$slug}` is invalid as it cannot contain slashes. To organise entries in subfolders, use the `path` option instead of `slug`.","invalid_identifier_field":"The `identifier_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","invalid_filter_field":"The `filter` option refers to `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","invalid_filter_no_condition":"The `filter` option must have either the `value` or `pattern` option to match entries against.","option_field_not_found":"The `{$option}` option refers to `{$name}`, but no such field is defined.","thumbnail_field_not_media":"The `thumbnail` option refers to `{$name}`, but it must be an Image or File field, not a `{$widget}` field.","invalid_inline_component_fields":"The `inline` mode requires a single Boolean, Colour, DateTime, Number, Relation, Select or String field. A Relation or Select field can’t have the `multiple` option enabled.","invalid_regex":"The `{$option}` option contains an invalid regular expression `{$pattern}`, which is ignored.","invalid_reorder_group":"The `reorder` option refers to a view group named `{$name}`, but no such group is defined in the `view_groups` option.","invalid_bulk_edit_field":"The `fields` list of the `bulk_edit` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such top-level field is defined in the collection.","unsupported_bulk_edit_field":"The `{$name}` field in the `fields` list of the `bulk_edit` option can’t be edited in bulk. Only a Boolean, Colour, DateTime, Number, Relation, Select or String field that isn’t read-only, doesn’t have the `multiple` option enabled and isn’t set automatically on save is supported.","invalid_sortable_field":"The `sortable_fields` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","invalid_table_column_field":"The `{$option}` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","invalid_view_group_field":"The `view_groups` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","invalid_view_filter_field":"The `view_filters` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection.","missing_view_group_name":"The view group {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_view_group_name":"The view group name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.","duplicate_view_group_name":"View group names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","missing_view_filter_name":"The view filter {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_view_filter_no_condition":"The view filter {$count} must have the `pattern` option or a comparison option such as `eq` or `gte` to match entries against.","invalid_view_filter_name":"The view filter name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.","duplicate_view_filter_name":"View filter names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","invalid_view_group_default":"The `default` option of `view_groups` is set to `{$name}`, but no view group has that name.","invalid_view_filter_default":"The `default` option of `view_filters` is set to `{$name}`, but no view filter has that name.","missing_collection_name":"The collection {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_collection_name":"The collection name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.","duplicate_collection_name":"Collection names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","missing_collection_file_name":"The collection file {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_collection_file_name":"The collection file name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.","duplicate_collection_file_name":"Collection file names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","collection_no_fields":"The collection must have the `fields` option defined with at least one field.","collection_file_no_fields":"The collection file must have the `fields` option defined with at least one field.","collection_folder_i18n_required":"The collection must have the `i18n` option defined if the `locale` placeholder is used in the `folder` path.","invalid_collection_folder_locale":"The `folder` path `{$folder}` is invalid. The `locale` placeholder must be used only once as a whole folder name, like `content/\\{\\{locale\\}\\}/posts`.","collection_file_i18n_required":"The collection file must have the `i18n` option defined if the `locale` placeholder is used in the `file` path.","collection_i18n_no_fields":"The collection has the `i18n` option, but none of its fields have the `i18n` option, so no field can be translated. Add `i18n: true` or `i18n: duplicate` to the fields to translate.","collection_i18n_no_files":"The collection has the `i18n` option, but none of its files have the `i18n` option, so no file can be translated. Add `i18n: true` to the files to translate.","collection_file_i18n_no_fields":"The collection file has the `i18n` option, but none of its fields have the `i18n` option, so no field can be translated. Add `i18n: true` or `i18n: duplicate` to the fields to translate.","missing_field_name":"The field {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_field_name":"The field name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters. If you want to nest fields, <a>use Object fields instead of dot notation</a>.","duplicate_field_name":"Field names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","missing_variable_type":"The variable type {$count} must have the `name` option defined as a non-empty string.","invalid_variable_type":"The variable type name `{$name}` is invalid. It must not contain special characters.","duplicate_variable_type":"Variable type names must be unique, but `{$name}` is used more than once.","date_field_type":"The deprecated Date field type is not supported in Sveltia CMS. Use the DateTime field type with the `type: date` option instead.","hidden_field_locale_without_i18n":"The `default` option of a Hidden field uses the `\\{\\{locale\\}\\}` placeholder, but i18n isn’t enabled for the collection, so the content has no locale to fill it with.","invalid_timezone":"Invalid timezone: {$timeZone}. Must be a valid IANA timezone identifier like `America/New_York` or `Asia/Tokyo`.","unsupported_deprecated_option":"The deprecated `{$prop}` option is not supported in Sveltia CMS. Use the `{$newProp}` option instead.","allow_multiple":"The `allow_multiple` option is not supported in Sveltia CMS. Use the `multiple` option instead, which defaults to `false`.","invalid_list_field":"The List field cannot have the `field`, `fields` and `types` options together.","invalid_list_variable_type":"The List field’s variable type is invalid. The `widget` option is set to `{$widget}` but it must be `object`.","invalid_object_field":"The Object field cannot have the `fields` and `types` options together.","invalid_range_options":"The `{$min}` option must not be greater than the `{$max}` option.","invalid_step":"The `step` option is set to `{$step}`, but it must be greater than zero, or `-1` to turn stepping off.","select_field_no_options":"The Select field must have at least one item in the `options` option.","select_field_duplicate_option":"The Select field’s `options` must be unique, but `{$value}` is used more than once.","select_field_invalid_default":"The Select field’s `default` option is set to `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `options`.","list_field_no_subfields":"The List field’s `fields` or `types` option must have at least one item. Omit the option for a list of plain values.","list_field_invalid_default_object":"The List field’s `default` option contains an object, but each item must be a plain value because the field has no `fields` or `types`.","list_field_invalid_default_item":"The List field’s `default` option contains `{$value}`, but each item must be an object because the field has `fields` or `types`.","list_field_invalid_default_key":"The List field’s `default` option contains an item with the `{$key}` property, but no subfield has that name.","list_field_default_missing_type":"The List field’s `default` option contains an item without the `{$typeKey}` property, which identifies one of the `types`.","list_field_invalid_default_type":"The List field’s `default` option contains an item whose `{$typeKey}` property is `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `types`.","list_field_map_key_no_subfields":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option requires the `fields` or `types` option, as each key is taken from a subfield.","list_field_map_key_not_found":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but no subfield has that name.","list_field_map_key_missing_in_type":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the `{$type}` type has no subfield with that name.","list_field_map_key_invalid_type":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but it must be a String, Relation or Select field, not a `{$widget}` field.","list_field_map_key_multiple":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t take multiple values, as each item needs a single key. Remove its `multiple` option.","list_field_map_key_option_not_string":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield’s options must have string values, as each key is stored as a string.","list_field_map_key_not_required":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t be optional, as each item needs a key. Remove its `required` option.","list_field_map_key_not_localized":"The List field’s `map_key_field` option refers to `{$name}`, but the subfield can’t have `i18n: false`, as the items need a key in every locale. Use `i18n: duplicate` or remove the option.","duplicate_if_empty_multiple":"The `i18n: duplicate_if_empty` option is not supported for a field with the `multiple` option, so the field works like one with `i18n: true`.","invalid_default_multiple":"The `default` option must be an array because the `multiple` option is `true`.","invalid_default_single":"The `default` option must be a single value, not an array, because the `multiple` option is not `true`.","object_field_invalid_default_key":"The Object field’s `default` option has the `{$key}` property, but no subfield has that name.","object_field_default_missing_type":"The Object field’s `default` option doesn’t have the `{$typeKey}` property, which identifies one of the `types`.","object_field_invalid_default_type":"The `{$typeKey}` property of the Object field’s `default` option is `{$value}`, but it’s not one of the `types`.","code_field_invalid_default_object":"The Code field’s `default` option must be a string because the `output_code_only` option is `true`.","code_field_invalid_default_key":"The Code field’s `default` option has the `{$key}` property, but the `keys` option only allows `{$code}` and `{$lang}`.","compute_field_invalid_expression":"The Compute field’s `value` option must be a valid arithmetic expression, like `\\{\\{fields.price\\}\\} * \\{\\{fields.quantity\\}\\}`, because the `value_type` option is `{$valueType}`.","compute_field_uuid_in_expression":"The Compute field’s `value` option can’t use a UUID tag like `\\{\\{uuid\\}\\}` because the `value_type` option is `{$valueType}`, which makes it an arithmetic expression.","number_field_default_not_integer":"The Number field’s `default` option is set to `{$value}`, but it must be an integer because the `value_type` option is `{$valueType}`.","number_field_default_not_number":"The Number field’s `default` option is set to `{$value}`, but it must be a number because the `value_type` option is `{$valueType}`.","object_field_no_subfields":"The Object field’s `fields` or `types` option must have at least one item.","relation_field_invalid_collection":"The referenced `{$collection}` collection is invalid or not defined.","relation_field_invalid_collection_file":"The referenced `{$file}` file is invalid or not defined.","relation_field_missing_file_name":"The `file` option must be defined for a relation to a file collection.","relation_field_invalid_value_field":"The referenced value field `{$field}` is invalid or not defined.","relation_field_array_file_slug":"The relation to the `{$collection}` collection can’t store the `\\{\\{slug\\}\\}` value, as an entry’s slug in a collection with the `file` option is its position, which changes when the entries are reordered or deleted. Set the `value_field` option to a field with a unique value instead.","relation_field_array_file_workflow":"A collection with the `file` option can’t have a relation to the `{$collection}` collection, which uses Editorial Workflow or Preview Workflow, as the references to an entry renamed or deleted there can’t be updated in the file.","relation_field_invalid_display_field":"The referenced display field `{$field}` is invalid or not defined.","relation_field_invalid_search_field":"The referenced search field `{$field}` is invalid or not defined.","relation_field_invalid_filter_field":"The referenced filter field `{$field}` is invalid or not defined.","unexpected":"Unexpected error","schema_invalid_type":"The `{$option}` option must be {$type}.","schema_invalid_enum":"The `{$option}` option must be one of these values: {$values}.","schema_invalid_const":"The `{$option}` option must be `{$value}`.","schema_invalid_empty_value":"The `{$option}` option must be an empty string.","schema_invalid_item_count":"The `{$option}` option must be an array of {$count} items.","schema_invalid_value":"The `{$option}` option has an invalid value.","schema_missing_option":"The `{$option}` option is required.","schema_missing_one_of":"One of these options is required: {$options}.","schema_value_type":{"string":"a string","number":"a number","integer":"an integer","boolean":"a boolean","array":"an array","object":"an object","null":"empty"}},"warning":{"oauth_no_app_id":"OAuth application ID is not defined. Users are required to provide an access token to sign in.","unsupported_ignored_option":"The `{$prop}` option is not supported in Sveltia CMS. It will be ignored.","publish_mode_stages_ignored":"The `stages` option of `publish_mode` only applies to the `editorial_workflow` publish mode, so it’s ignored with `{$type}`.","conflicting_timezone_options":"Both `picker_utc` and newer timezone options (`input_timezone` or `output_utc`) are set. The new options take precedence. Consider removing `picker_utc` from your configuration.","localize_format_without_format":"The `localize_format` option has no effect, because the field has no `format` option and its value is stored in the ISO 8601 format.","compute_field_wildcard_without_item":"The Compute field’s `value` option refers to `{$name}`, but the field isn’t in an item of the list that `*` stands for, so it resolves to nothing. Only an aggregate function like `sum()` can use every item of a list.","compute_field_self_reference":"The Compute field’s `value` option refers to the field itself as `{$name}`, so its value changes every time it’s computed and never settles.","compute_field_reference_cycle":"The Compute field’s `value` option refers to `{$name}`, another Compute field that refers back to this field, directly or through other fields, so their values never settle.","localize_format_without_i18n":"The `localize_format` option is `true`, but i18n isn’t enabled for the collection, so the value is written in English. Set the option to a locale code like `de` instead.","localize_format_unsupported_locale":"The `localize_format` option is set to `{$locale}`, which isn’t a supported locale, so the value is written in English.","preview_path_no_date_field":"The `preview_path` option uses date and time tags, but the collection has no DateTime field to read them from, so the preview link won’t be shown.","preview_path_date_field_not_found":"The `preview_path_date_field` option refers to a field named `{$name}`, but no DateTime field with that name is defined, so the preview link won’t be shown.","preview_path_field_not_found":"The `preview_path` option refers to `{$name}`, but no such field is defined in the collection, so the preview link won’t be shown.","missing_identifier_field":"The collection has no `{$name}` field to name new entries with, so each new entry gets a random slug. Add a `{$name}` field, or set the `identifier_field` or `slug` option.","slug_i18n_ineffective":"The `i18n` option of `slug` has no effect, because the collection doesn’t use the `multiple_files`, `multiple_folders` or `multiple_root_folders` i18n structure, where each locale has a file of its own.","slug_template_ignored":"The `template` option of `slug` is ignored, because the `auto_increment` option numbers the slugs instead.","locale_not_omitted_from_file_path":"The `locale` placeholder can’t be removed from the `file` path `{$file}`, so the default locale is kept in it despite the `omit_default_locale_from_file_path` i18n option. To leave the locale out, use the placeholder as a whole folder name, like `\\{\\{locale\\}\\}/about.md`, or between the file name and the extension, like `about.\\{\\{locale\\}\\}.md`. To keep it, set the option to `false` in the file’s `i18n` option.","i18n_not_configured":"The `i18n` option is enabled, but i18n is not configured at the top level of the configuration or in the collection, so the option has no effect.","empty_public_folder":"The `public_folder` option is an empty string, so the `media_folder` path is used for the asset paths saved in entries instead. Remove the option, or set it to the path you want to use, such as `/images`.","schema_unknown_option":"The `{$option}` option is not defined in the Sveltia CMS configuration schema. It will be ignored. Check for a typo or a syntax mistake.","default_localized_without_i18n":"The `default_localized` option has no effect, because i18n isn’t enabled for the collection. Use the `default` option instead.","default_localized_unknown_locale":"The `default_localized` option has a value for `{$locale}`, which isn’t one of the collection’s locales, so the value is never used."},"compatibility_link":"See the compatibility notes for details: {$link}","schema_tip":"For a better developer experience, you can validate your configuration file against the JSON schema of Sveltia CMS. See {$link} for details."},"local_workflow":{"indicator":"Local","unsupported_browser":"Local Workflow is not supported in your browser. Please use Chrome or Edge instead.","disabled":"Local Workflow is disabled in your browser. <a>Here’s how to enable it</a>."},"viewing_editorial_workflow":"You’re now viewing the Editorial Workflow board. Drafts: {$draft}. In Review: {$review}. Ready: {$ready}. Pending Deletion: {$deletion}.","viewing_open_authoring_workflow":"You’re now viewing the Editorial Workflow board. Drafts: {$draft}. In Review: {$review}. Pending Deletion: {$deletion}.","viewing_editorial_workflow_without_review":"You’re now viewing the Editorial Workflow board. Drafts: {$draft}. Ready: {$ready}. Pending Deletion: {$deletion}.","viewing_preview_workflow":"You’re now viewing the Drafts page. Drafts: {$draft}. Pending Deletion: {$deletion}.","status":{"draft":"Draft","drafts":"Drafts","in_review":"In Review","ready":"Ready","pending_deletion":"Pending Deletion","deploying":"Deploying"},"workflow":{"cancel_deletion":"Cancel Deletion","confirm_cancelling_deletion":"Are you sure you want to cancel this deletion? The entry will remain published.","confirm_completing_deletion":"Are you sure you want to delete this entry? It will be removed right away.","deletion_pending":".input {$count :integer} .match $count one {{Entry marked for deletion.}} * {{{$count} entries marked for deletion.}}","changes_discarded":".input {$count :integer} .match $count one {{Changes discarded.}} * {{Changes to {$count} entries discarded.}}","cancelling_deletion":"Cancelling Deletion…","deletion_cancelled":"Deletion cancelled.","cancelling_deletion_failed":"Couldn’t cancel the deletion. Please try again.","unpublished_entries":"Unpublished Entries","published_entries":"Published Entries","entry_status_value":"Status: {$status}","change_entry_status":"Change Entry Status","changing_status":"Changing Status…","updating_status":"Updating Status…","status_updated":"Status updated.","status_change_failed":"Couldn’t change the status. Please try again.","status_change_blocked":"The entry has errors. Please correct them before changing the status.","publish_blocked":"The entry has errors. Please correct them before publishing it.","send_for_review":"Send for Review","confirm_sending_for_review":"Your changes have been saved as a draft. Send the entry for review so someone can look at it and publish it?","mark_as_ready":"Mark as Ready","confirm_marking_as_ready":"Your changes have been saved as a draft. Mark the entry as ready so it can be published?","publish_entry":"Publish Entry","discard_changes":"Discard Changes","confirm_deleting_published_entry":"Are you sure you want to delete this entry? It won’t be removed until the deletion is published. Until then you’ll still find it in the entry list, marked Pending Deletion.","confirm_deleting_unpublished_entry":"This entry hasn’t been published yet, so deleting it will discard it completely.","confirm_discarding_entry_changes":"This entry has unpublished changes. Discarding them will restore the published version. The entry itself won’t be deleted.","deleting_unpublished_note_all":".input {$count :integer} .match $count one {{It hasn’t been published yet, so your unpublished changes will be discarded. Any published version will remain published.}} * {{They haven’t been published yet, so your unpublished changes will be discarded. Any published versions will remain published.}}","deleting_unpublished_note_some":".input {$count :integer} .match $count one {{One of them hasn’t been published yet, so your unpublished changes will be discarded. Any published version will remain published.}} * {{{$count} of them haven’t been published yet, so your unpublished changes will be discarded. Any published versions will remain published.}}","confirm_publishing_entry_after_build":"Are you sure you want to publish this entry? Your changes will go live once your site has been rebuilt.","publishing_entry":"Publishing Entry…","entry_published":"Entry published.","deleting_entry":"Deleting Entry…","discarding_changes":"Discarding Changes…","entry_deleted":"Entry deleted.","publishing_entry_failed":"Couldn’t publish the entry. Please try again.","publish_refused_other_changes":"This entry can’t be published here, because it comes with other changes the CMS can’t show you. Ask a developer to review it.","publish_refused_entry_changed":"The entry has been changed since you opened it. Reload the page to review the latest version before publishing it.","branch_in_use":"Another request ({$number}) is already open for this entry outside the CMS. Ask a developer to close it first.","no_entries":"No entries.","drag_entry":"Drag to change the status","deploying_deletion":"Deletion"},"commit_message":{"title":"Commit Message","description_replace":"Describe your changes. The message is recorded in the history along with them.","description_addition":"Add a note to the message recorded in the history along with your changes, such as an issue number. It can be left empty.","message":"Commit message","addition":"Note","preview":"Message: {$message}"},"open_authoring":{"fork_repository":"Fork Repository","fork":"Fork","confirm_forking_repository":"To suggest changes to “{$repo}”, a fork of the repository has to be created on your account. Your changes are saved to that fork, and a maintainer reviews them before they go live.","fork_declined":"You need a fork of the repository on your account to suggest changes.","fork_failed":"Couldn’t create a fork of the “{$repo}” repository on your account.","fork_branch_missing":"Your “{$fork}” fork doesn’t have the “{$branch}” branch. Update the fork from the “{$repo}” repository, then sign in again.","permission_check_failed":"Couldn’t check your access to the “{$repo}” repository. Please try again in a moment.","forking_disabled":"The “{$repo}” repository doesn’t allow forks. Ask a maintainer to enable forking for it.","invitation_pending":"You have a pending invitation to the “{$repo}” repository. Accept it on GitHub, then sign in again.","private_repo_scope_required":"Your sign-in doesn’t include access to private repositories, so the “{$repo}” repository can’t be read. Ask a maintainer to check the CMS authentication settings.","publish_unsupported":"Only a maintainer can publish changes to this site. Mark your entry as In Review instead, and someone will take a look.","entry_already_published":"A maintainer has already published this entry, so there’s nothing left to review.","direct_commit_unsupported":"This change can’t be made directly. Only edits to entries can be suggested for review.","contributing_via_fork":"Your changes are saved to your fork of this repository at “{$repo}” and reviewed before they go live.","view_fork":"View Fork"},"categories":"Categories","site_configuration_editor":"Site Configuration Editor","prefs":{"changes":{"api_key_saved":"API key saved.","api_key_removed":"API key removed.","api_key_invalid":"The provided API key is invalid. Please double-check and try again."},"error":{"permissio